{
  "name": "Insurance Tools MCP - Claims and Service",
  "displayName": "Insurance Tools MCP - Claims & Service",
  "description": "Insurance Claims & Service: look up policyholders, policies, coverage, claims, bills and renewals; file claims, book adjuster inspections, add drivers, issue ID cards, open service cases and refund premium bills (gateway limit $50). No underwriting finance or portfolio analytics.",
